# My_buddy — Agentic GenAI Personal Assistant  
A Multi-Agent, RAG-Powered, Full-Stack AI Productivity Platform

My_buddy is an agentic personal assistant powered by modern GenAI technologies.  
It uses multi-agent reasoning, RAG (Retrieval Augmented Generation), an orchestrator layer,  
and a complete frontend + backend stack to deliver an intelligent productivity system.

This project demonstrates full-stack GenAI engineering skills suitable for professional hiring evaluations.

---

