## 2. Multi-Agent System

### Orchestrator
Coordinates all AI behavior:
- Detects user intent  
- Routes tasks to the correct agent  
- Provides memory and context  
- Fallback to LLM when uncertain  

### TaskAgent
Handles task and goal operations:
- Create, update, delete, complete  
- Auto-categorization  
- Links tasks with goals  

### ScheduleAgent
AI scheduling:
- Suggests ideal time slots  
- Learns from user patterns  
- Optimizes productivity windows  

### AnalyticsAgent
Insight generation:
- Productivity scores  
- Goal alignment  
- Historical trends  
- Weekly performance analysis  

### QueryAgent (RAG)
Retrieval-Augmented Generation:
- Embeds user data  
- Vector search (ChromaDB)  
- Supplies context to LLM  
- Produces accurate, factual answers  

---

## 3. RAG Pipeline

[User Query]
│
▼
[Embed via SentenceTransformer MiniLM]
│
▼
[ChromaDB Vector Search]
│
▼
[Top-K Documents Retrieved]
│
▼
[Context Injection to Llama3]
│
▼
[Final Answer Returned]

